## Coding Standards (from tech_plan_v1)

- `requestAnimationFrame` for game loop (not `setInterval`)
- `performance.now()` for delta time (not `Date.now()`)
- Max cyclomatic complexity: 10. Max function length: 40 lines.
- No `eval()`, `new Function()`, `innerHTML` with user data
- Expose tuning knobs via config object, never hardcode gameplay values

